@startuml
title find_me_in_wood — LNP/1: peers negotiate the fallback ladder in-band, then switch on their own
autonumber
participant "A" as A
participant "B" as B

== 1. Offers (inside encrypted, signed beacons) ==
A ->> B : BT beacon {link.offers=[BT, WD, SMS(+380..A)]}
B ->> A : BT beacon {link.offers=[BT, SMS(+380..B)]}
A -> A : ladder(A,B) = [BT, SMS(B)]  h=crc
B -> B : ladder(B,A) = [BT, SMS(A)]  same h

== 2. Agreement (acks) ==
A ->> B : BT beacon {link.acks=[B:h]}
B ->> A : BT beacon {link.acks=[A:h]}
note over A, B : peer ack == own hash -> ladder agreed.\nOnly now may costly rungs (LoRa, SMS) be used.

== 3. Down-switch (no round trip possible any more) ==
note over A, B : walk apart: no direct BT/WD frame\nfor 3 beacon intervals on both sides
A -> A : active(B) = SMS
B -> B : active(A) = SMS
A ->> B : SMS "FMIW1:..." position report\n(every 30 min, max 10/h)
B ->> A : SMS position report
note over A, B : map keeps both positions, marked "via SMS"

== 4. Up-switch ==
B ->> A : BT beacon (direct, TTL intact)
A -> A : active(B) = BT, SMS to B stops
A ->> B : BT beacon
B -> B : active(A) = BT
@enduml
